# p07 withheld: value exists but is not released
#
# LinkML option: option3 sibling reason slot in this shape (the status is about the datum);
# the same reason value can ride in option1, 1b or 2.
#
# ILLUSTRATIVE AND INVENTED: the archive holds a DNA comparison between material attributed to
# Napoleon and a living descendant. The genotyping assay completed and produced a datum, but the
# released graph carries no value, only a GENEPIO:0001810 'restricted access' status about the
# datum (for example, because the descendant is a living person).
#
# A consumer can infer that the datum exists (GENEPIO defines restricted access as "the data ...
# is available but not shared publicly"), so asking the data holder is worthwhile. That is what
# distinguishes it from p03/p04, where no value was collected or provided.
# They cannot infer anything about the result itself.

@prefix rdf:     <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs:    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix owl:     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix xsd:     <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix ex:      <https://example.org/napoleon/> .
@prefix IAO:     <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_> .
@prefix OBI:     <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_> .
@prefix GENEPIO: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GENEPIO_> .
@prefix NCBITaxon: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_> .

ex:descendant1 a owl:NamedIndividual , NCBITaxon:9606 ;
    rdfs:label "descendant 1 (invented)" .

ex:dnaSample1 a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "DNA sample from descendant 1 (invented)" .

ex:dnaComparison1 a owl:NamedIndividual , OBI:0000435 ;
    rdfs:label "descendant DNA comparison 1 (invented)" ;
    OBI:0000293 ex:dnaSample1 ;
    OBI:0000299 ex:dnaDatum1 .

ex:dnaDatum1 a owl:NamedIndividual , IAO:0000109 ;
    IAO:0000136 ex:napoleon , ex:descendant1 .
    # result withheld from this release

ex:status7 a owl:NamedIndividual , GENEPIO:0001810 ;
    IAO:0000136 ex:dnaDatum1 .
